1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:04,629
Welcome to Melody and
Barnaby's Music Nuggets!

2
00:00:05,629 --> 00:00:11,409
Today we are going to
learn about thumb on C.

3
00:00:13,409 --> 00:00:17,889
Just the right hand… the
left hand comes later.

4
00:00:18,389 --> 00:00:20,686
Show me your right hand.

5
00:00:23,486 --> 00:00:31,216
This is the C nearest the middle of
the piano… so it is called Middle C.

6
00:00:34,016 --> 00:00:37,288
Put your thumb… on Middle C.

7
00:00:40,488 --> 00:00:42,878
Each finger has a number.

8
00:00:43,078 --> 00:00:43,728
One.

9
00:00:43,778 --> 00:00:44,521
Two.

10
00:00:44,571 --> 00:00:45,361
Three.

11
00:00:45,411 --> 00:00:46,154
Four.

12
00:00:46,204 --> 00:00:47,404
Five.

13
00:00:50,400 --> 00:00:52,697
Each finger plays a note.

14
00:00:52,797 --> 00:00:53,448
C

15
00:00:53,498 --> 00:00:54,241
D

16
00:00:54,291 --> 00:00:54,816
E

17
00:00:54,866 --> 00:00:55,562
F

18
00:00:55,612 --> 00:00:56,812
G

19
00:00:59,409 --> 00:01:04,028
When your thumb is on
C… finger three plays E.

20
00:01:07,228 --> 00:01:13,240
Each time, we move to the
next key… That is a step.

21
00:01:19,940 --> 00:01:21,912
Miss out a finger…

22
00:01:22,212 --> 00:01:24,091
That is a skip.

23
00:01:27,691 --> 00:01:31,984
Here are the same five
notes… on the stave.

24
00:01:38,784 --> 00:01:40,338
Play with me!

25
00:01:40,538 --> 00:01:41,189
One.

26
00:01:41,239 --> 00:01:41,982
Two.

27
00:01:42,032 --> 00:01:42,821
Three.

28
00:01:42,871 --> 00:01:43,614
Four.

29
00:01:43,664 --> 00:01:44,864
Five.

30
00:01:51,261 --> 00:01:54,533
Your turn! Look and listen.

31
00:01:54,933 --> 00:01:56,998
Which finger plays E?

32
00:02:01,098 --> 00:02:02,298
Three.

33
00:02:04,187 --> 00:02:06,995
Which note does finger five play?

34
00:02:11,095 --> 00:02:12,295
G

35
00:02:14,091 --> 00:02:17,410
Is this… a step or a skip?

36
00:02:21,510 --> 00:02:22,971
A skip.

37
00:02:23,871 --> 00:02:25,193
You've got it!

38
00:02:26,893 --> 00:02:28,354
Now it's your turn!

39
00:02:28,554 --> 00:02:32,569
Play Finger Number Fun
and find the notes!

40
00:02:34,369 --> 00:02:38,679
Grown-ups, subscribe so
you never miss a Nugget.

41
00:02:38,729 --> 00:02:41,913
New ones every Wednesday and Saturday.

42
00:02:42,213 --> 00:02:44,603
See you for the next Nugget!

